        <mxCell id="finding" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#18333e;strokeColor=#4d7682;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;Finding:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(24, 51, 62), rgb(178, 202, 211));&quot;&gt;CJ-607, CJ-604, CJ-603 are all BRIDGE reports and yet they didn&#39;t route to Structures, instead they routed to Electrical. This pattern can be viewed in W06-S02 and W06-S04.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unanswered question: What configuration does the routing table show for BRIDGES in order for them to be routed to Electrical instead of Structures?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
